###

### RF-12: Alertas activas de mis pacientes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/alerts?status=ACTIVE&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### RF-12: Alertas de María (todos los estados)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/alerts/patient/{{patientMariaId}}?status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### RF-12: Resolver alerta
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/alerts/77eea88c-2455-4809-a4cc-a86a77ef1f91/resolve
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "observations": "El paciente está bien, fue una falsa alarma"
}

###

### RF-12: Cancelar alerta
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/alerts/539f1f2e-c339-49c2-bccd-c95e07e1f904/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

