### Crear alerta SOS
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/alerts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "device_id": "b1689531-158a-4d74-9721-a75908906560",
  "alert_type": "SOS_MANUAL",
  "latitude": 37.3891,
  "longitude": -5.9845,
  "heart_rate": 95.0,
  "timestamp": {{$timestamp}}
}